      "name": "Sugar Rush",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The melixie consumes a large quantity of sugar, honey, nectar, or similar sweets and goes into a frenzied state. The melixie immediately Strides or Flies.</p>\n<p>For the next 1d4+1 rounds, the melixie is Quickened, and can use the additional action only to Stride or Fly. As soon as the rush ends, the melixie is Fatigued for 1 minute.</p>",
